message: "If you use or refer to this software or its documentation, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Yomumi Harness"
abstract: >-
  A Rust CLI that verifies Bun JUnit XML test evidence (yomumi-evidence), and
  documentation of a local multi-agent AI coding harness: task dispatch, model
  routing, a weekly token budget, an agent-to-agent channel and evidence-first
  verification.
authors:
